>> title: Russian Dressing
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: mayonnaise, horseradish, dressing, no-cook, deli
>> counters: Deli, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: russian, deli russian, reuben dressing, russian sauce, russian mayo
>> pairs-with: mayonnaise, corned-beef, coleslaw, pastrami
>> servings: 12
>> time: 1 hr 10 min

>> step: whisk the base
Whisk @mayonnaise{1%cup}(240 mL) with @chili sauce{1/3%cup}(80 mL; the ketchup-style bottle, not sriracha), @prepared horseradish{2%Tbs}(drained), @Worcestershire sauce{1%tsp}, @sweet paprika{1%tsp}, @cayenne{1/8%tsp} and @lemon juice{2%tsp} until it is one even coral colour.

>> step: fold in the chopped things
Fold @dill pickle{2%Tbs}(minced fine, squeezed dry), @yellow onion{1%Tbs}(grated on a microplane, juice and all) and @chives{1%Tbs}(sliced thin) into @&(~1)base{}.

>> step: chill 1 hr
Chill @&(~1)dressing{} for at least ~chill{1%hr} before it goes near anything.
